Food Rations aren't the only thing to eat - dead monsters can be good.
Some kinds will give you benefits besides just food value.
Others are poisonous or have other bad effects.
Most corpses will spoil if you leave them around for a while, though;
food poisoning is a dumb way to die.

Experiment a lot!  Eat fortune cookies, but don't always trust them!

Also, if you're really feeling weak, try praying.  But don't get greedy!
Also use the Help command to find out the basics about the game.

